WEBVTT

00:14:58.875 --> 00:15:01.809
It was awful beyond imagining.

00:15:01.833 --> 00:15:06.934
If you ever find yourselves
in a situation where you think

00:15:06.958 --> 00:15:10.184
"There's no way
I'm coming back from this,"

00:15:10.208 --> 00:15:13.434
I urge you to lean into these strategies

00:15:13.458 --> 00:15:15.458
and think again.

00:15:16.958 --> 00:15:19.101
I won't pretend

00:15:19.125 --> 00:15:21.625
that thinking this way is easy.

00:15:22.458 --> 00:15:25.601
And it doesn't remove all the pain.

00:15:25.625 --> 00:15:30.351
But if I've learned anything
over the last five years,